Revised sources for "alr" (alternating logistic regression)
for Splus have been posted at 

http://biosun1.harvard.edu/~carey/gee.html

This revision corrects a bug (numerically undetectable in 
a number of applications examined thus far, and inferentially
innocuous in all applications examined thus far) apparently 
emanating from obsolete f2c translation of linpack/blas 
routines.  Notes on the bug are provided at the aforementioned web
site.  The revision also modifies the definition of the 
pairwise log odds ratio regression design matrix and includes 
a compatible version of "class2z", a pairwise log odds ratio 
regression design matrix generator developed by P. Heagerty
of U. Washington.

